OL,3,GNEWSAHow Westside Cowboy went from     
OL,4,Astudent gigs to rising stars in two    
OL,5,Ayears                                  
OL,7,FIn two years, Westside Cowboy have     
OL,8,Frocketed from the sweaty corners of    
OL,9,FManchester's student pub circuit to    
OL,10,Fperformances on one of America's       
OL,11,Fbiggest talk shows and at many of the  
OL,12,FUK's biggest festivals.                
OL,14,FWhat started as jamming for fun in a   
OL,15,Fstudent bedroom has become the latest  
OL,16,Frevolution in British indie known as   
OL,17,F"Britainicana".                        
OL,19,FNow the quartet have been named the BBC
OL,20,FIntroducing Artist of the Year for     
OL,21,F2026.                                  
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
